Son of Good Family, you should not cultivate only one type of goodness, illuminate only one dharma, practice only one practice, make only one vow, receive only one prediction, and dwell in only one type of patience and think you have achieved the ultimate; You should not rely on a limited resolve to practice the six perfections, dwell on the ten grounds, purify the buddha lands and serve one’s good spiritual guides.
