They are able to cause one to block access to the wretched destinies; They are able to cause one to use the light of Dharma for illumination; They are able to cause one to rely on the rain of Dharma for moisture; They are able to cause one to extinguish all afflictions; They are able to cause one to relinquish all wrong views; They are able to cause one to grow in the wisdom of all buddhas; and They are able to cause one to become established in the dharmas of a buddha.
