Is the abode of those who, in but a single mind-moment, know all three periods of time; Is the abode of those who, in but a single mind-moment, travel to all lands to pay their respects; Is the abode of those who manifest their bodies directly before all beings; Is the abode of those whose minds always benefit everyone in the entire world; 
