It is the abode of: Those who, although they have achieved sovereign mastery over all karma and afflictions, in order to teach beings, still manifest the appearance of following karma and afflictions; Those who, although they have become free of births and deaths, in order to teach beings, still manifest the appearance of being subject to birth and death; and Those who, although they have already transcended all the rebirth destinies, in order to teach beings, still manifest the appearance of entering into the rebirth destinies. 
